{"meta":{"id":"event-animate","category":"it/syntax/jquery/event","title":"이벤트 · 애니메이션 · jQuery","subtitle":"(JQUERY · AJAX)","summary":"click · on, mouseenter / mouseleave 로 class 토글, 이벤트 위임, animate · fade","tags":["jquery","f-event"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-amber","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>JQUERY · AJAX</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">이벤트 · 애니메이션 · jQuery</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> click · on, mouseenter / mouseleave 로 class 토글, 이벤트 위임, animate · fade</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">이벤트</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">$(&quot;.menu input[name=&#x27;hobby&#x27;]&quot;).click(function () { console.log($(this).val()); });\r\n$(&quot;#btn&quot;).on(&quot;click&quot;, function () { });\r\n\r\n$(&quot;#box&quot;).on(&quot;mouseenter&quot;, function () { $(this).addClass(&quot;hover&quot;); });   // 마우스가 들어오면\r\n$(&quot;#box&quot;).on(&quot;mouseleave&quot;, function () { $(this).removeClass(&quot;hover&quot;); }); // 나가면\r\n\r\n$(document).on(&quot;click&quot;, &quot;.dynamic&quot;, function () { });   // 나중에 추가된 요소에도 적용 (위임)</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">this 는 이벤트가 일어난 요소 — $(this) 로 감싸서 사용</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">애니메이션</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">$(&quot;#box&quot;).animate(\r\n  { left: &quot;200px&quot;, opacity: 0.5 },   // 바꿀 css\r\n  1000,                               // 진행 시간 (ms)\r\n  function () { /* 완료 후 실행 */ }\r\n);\r\n$(&quot;#box&quot;).fadeIn(300);  .fadeOut();  .slideToggle();  .show();  .hide();</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> JavaScript › 이벤트 (addEventListener)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jquery/event/event-animate","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jquery","title":"JQUERY · AJAX","path":"it/syntax/jquery"},{"id":"event","title":"이벤트 · 효과","path":"it/syntax/jquery/event"}],"hasImage":false}